--- text
Final notice before your subscription pauses

This is the last message about the payment for [PRODUCT_NAME]. The
charge of [CURRENCY] [AMOUNT] for [PLAN_NAME] did not go through,
and we have stopped retrying it.

The most common reason is a card that expired since you set it up.
Updating your payment method settles the amount and leaves
everything as it is.

Details of the payment

Amount: [CURRENCY] [AMOUNT]
Plan: [PLAN_NAME]
Payment method: [CARD_BRAND] ending [CARD_LAST4]
Invoice: [INVOICE_NUMBER]
Last attempt: [RETRY_DATE]

Important: On [GRACE_END_DATE] the subscription is paused. Your
data is not deleted, and you can still sign in after that date.

After [GRACE_END_DATE], until the payment method is updated:

- [PRODUCT_NAME] becomes read-only for all [SEAT_COUNT] seats.
- Scheduled work, integrations and API keys stop running.
- Sign-in, reading and exporting your data keep working.

Nothing is deleted. Your data is kept in full for
[RETENTION_PERIOD] after [GRACE_END_DATE], until [RETENTION_END_DATE].
Update the payment method before that date and the account returns
to [PLAN_NAME] with everything as you left it. After that date the
data is deleted and cannot be recovered.

Update payment method:

[CTA_URL]

If you would rather stop paying for [PRODUCT_NAME], you do not have
to do anything - the subscription pauses on its own on
[GRACE_END_DATE]. If you want it cancelled outright, or moved to a
smaller plan, write to [SUPPORT_EMAIL] and we will take care of it.

If any of these details look wrong, reply to this email, or write
to [SUPPORT_EMAIL]. A real person reads every message.

[SIGNOFF_NAME], [COMPANY_NAME]
